### 1. 测试正常流程 - 所有中间件正常执行
GET http://localhost:9501/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 测试 TestConditionMiddleware 截断
GET http://localhost:9501/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-stop-here: true

### 3. 测试 TestConditionMiddleware 跳过
GET http://localhost:9501/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-skip-condition: true

### 4. 测试 TestSkipMiddleware 截断
GET http://localhost:9501/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
x-test-cutdown: true

### 5. 测试首页路由（只有全局中间件）
GET http://localhost:9501/
Content-Type: application/json

